{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kibus Moon Rock is a sandbox game set in a fantasy space world where your creations will attract new critters, collect new pets, discover new biomes and unlock hundreds of items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/166b4521dae1dbd88af5bb682af6ba73.poster.avif?t=1761743028\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/166b4521dae1dbd88af5bb682af6ba73.webm?t=1761743028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/166b4521dae1dbd88af5bb682af6ba73.mp4?t=1761743028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILDING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create colourful forests or build farms, villages or cities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build on any new moon you discover. Building brings you a vast array of colours while you mix and match building parts to make your moon city as unique as your\u00a0imagination will let it be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/d7e393e59b1eb369c8aff2cb94df1d0c.poster.avif?t=1761743028\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/d7e393e59b1eb369c8aff2cb94df1d0c.webm?t=1761743028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/d7e393e59b1eb369c8aff2cb94df1d0c.mp4?t=1761743028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KIBOT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kibot its a robot created by Kibus to help out with building new worlds and to bring some fun your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Either you will be looking to destroy your placements or to change your building, the Kibot will be there to help you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/bb897656593607bd68e8753fd7052b8e.poster.avif?t=1761743028\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/bb897656593607bd68e8753fd7052b8e.webm?t=1761743028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/bb897656593607bd68e8753fd7052b8e.mp4?t=1761743028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KIBUS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kibus are the species that will join your moons once you start creating your world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This fun space species loves to hang around and have a good time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pet the critters and play with them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/f2554274e6df7efc142161a8cb140dae.poster.avif?t=1761743028\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/f2554274e6df7efc142161a8cb140dae.webm?t=1761743028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/f2554274e6df7efc142161a8cb140dae.mp4?t=1761743028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PETS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets will also appear and bring new life to your world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect them and unlock new species and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/76d8e842d184d36aabe258aa3d1d5e43.poster.avif?t=1761743028\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/76d8e842d184d36aabe258aa3d1d5e43.webm?t=1761743028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/76d8e842d184d36aabe258aa3d1d5e43.mp4?t=1761743028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COZY CITY BUILDER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the freedom to build at your own pace as there is no economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  The game features a gridless world so placements can go anywhere.<br>Just relax and enjoy creating your dream moon world!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734110?t=1761743028","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/8d0ebc51ecfa56e81f97fa71ca6fffbddcebedeb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761743028","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/e25c211a189838e061b45c1e0b6df88f42ade49b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761743028","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/e25c211a189838e061b45c1e0b6df88f42ade49b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761743028","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kibus Moon Rock is a sandbox game set in a fantasy space world where your creations will attract new cri